---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="What to Expect">
  <section class="container-x py-14 md:py-20">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-3xl font-semibold text-center">What to Expect</h1>

    <!-- Slogan -->
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg sm:text-2xl text-center text-gray-700">
      Come. See. <span class="text-[#B3282D]">Jesus</span>
    </p>

    <!-- Existing grid -->
    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 md:gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">

      <div class="rounded-xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-brand-red">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2 text-center">Hear the Good News</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 text-center">Clear, gospel-rich teaching from the Bible.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-brand-red">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2 text-center">A diverse community</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 text-center">Multiracial and multigenerational — you belong here.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-brand-red">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2 text-center">Music, singing & dancing</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 text-center">We echo heaven's joy with music singing and dancing.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-brand-red">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2 text-center">The Lord’s Table</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 text-center">We gather at the Table to remember what Jesus did for us.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-brand-red">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2 text-center">Extravagant generosity</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 text-center">Made rich by what Jesus has done, we are generous and share in all things.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-brand-red">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2 text-center">Go live the story</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 text-center">We are then sent out to live the story of Jesus aloud in our city, nation and the world.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- ⭐ NEW: Ministries Card -->
<div class="rounded-xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-brand-red">
  <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2 text-center">Life at the Life Place</h3>

  <p class="mt-2 text-gray-700 text-center">
The Life Place is made up of communities that help
people Come. See. <span class="text-[#B3282D]">Jesus</span> and live out His story in every sphere of life.
  </p>
</div>

  <!-- Kids Ministry (Coming Soon) -->
<div class="rounded-xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-brand-red text-center space-y-4">

  <!-- Header -->
  <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-darkgray">
    Kids @The Life Place
  </h3>

  <!-- Description -->
  <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
    At present there is no kids church. As Jesus supplies the resources needed,
    we will launch one where our children too will <em>Come. See. <span class="text-[#B3282D]">Jesus</span></em>
  </p>

  <p class="text-gray-700">
    Children are welcome to remain with their parents during service.
  </p>

  <!-- Coming Soon Pill (bottom, enlarged) -->
  <div class="pt-2">
    <span class="inline-block rounded-full bg-brand-red text-white px-5 py-2 text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide">
      Launching Soon
    </span>
  </div>

</div>


  </section>
</BaseLayout>
